{"time": "20261117T172217Z", "think": "Choose the pike.", "command": "say 3", "result": "Never-Writes-Twice: Never-Writes-Twice. Tells: a Ka-Deelith's pike, that drinks the life of what it strikes; go now. Does: sets stage 20.\nYou are now Ka-Deelith of Toh-Reel-Ka\nAdded: Ka-Deelith's Pike\nAdded: Toh-Reel-Ka Gauntlets and Boots\n\n*** Journal updated: At the Kings' Gate ***\nJournal: Never-Writes-Twice made me a Ka-Deelith, a War-Teacher of the Toh-Reel-Ka, and gave me the order's pike. Her watchers have not seen the Unbound near Teku-Sul, so I am ahead of them. I'm to dive to Teku-Sul Spire, open the Kings' Gate with the three stones and use the Eye where it sits to heal the trees. Then I'm to bring the stones back to her and hunt down Cuts-the-Old-Knot.\nObjective: Dive to Teku-Sul Spire and go to the Kings' Gate. (marker: The Kings' Gate)\n\nThe game pauses. Answer these four questions from what the game has shown you, in your own words, numbered, in one command: answer '1. ... 2. ... 3. ... 4. ...'\n1. What is going on? (who you work for, what has happened, why it matters, as far as you know)\n2. What are you expected to do next, and where?\n3. What options do you have for doing it? (the ways through you can see, and any choice in front of you)\n4. Is there any word, name, person or thing you do not understand? Do you know how you could find out?", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "helstrom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"fla