{"time": "20261117T172236Z", "think": "Ask for the reminder.", "command": "say 4", "result": "Never-Writes-Twice: Never-Writes-Twice, at the back of Nesh-Deekas House. Tells: the Eye of Argonia is the old priest-kings jewel, cut from Hist amber. It sits at the Root, the place under the sea below Teku-Sul Spire where the roots of every Hist meet. Used where it sits, it pours strength down every root and heals every sick tree; lifted from its place, it cuts every tree from every other for good. The last king shut it behind the Kings Gate, which opens only with its three seal-stones: the thiefs stone in Blackrose Prison, the stone in the flooded vaults of Gemin and the stone in the deepest hall of Vorannuhl. A beast guards the Root; Cuts-the-Old-Knot brews a draught from drained sap strong enough to kill it, so she can reach the Eye. The orders aim: take the stones first, open the gate, use the Eye in place to heal the trees, bring the stones back to her so the chamber is sealed for good, and end the Unbound. She looks at the stones the player carries and names the places of those still missing.\nTopics you can pick:\n1. What do the order's ranks mean?\n2. How do you know the Unbound are not at Teku-Sul?\n3. Fort Chalkmoth\n4. Remind me what we are hunting, and why.", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "helstrom", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-thief": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-vault": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn.seal-stone-deep": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-q